{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP11HypergraphsE18bConnectedVertices4fromSay6VertexQzGAH_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11Hypergraphs13IncidenceListV","remoteSource":{"fileName":"DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift#L383"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bConnectedVertices"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Hypergraphs","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"title":"bConnectedVertices(from:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every vertex B-connected to "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" included, in vertex-index order: Gallo et"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"al.‘s B-Visit (halp’s "},{"code":"b_visit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). A hyperedge fires once every one of its sources has been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached, and then reaches all its targets. On a directed graph read as a hypergraph this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reachability."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/bConnectedVertices(from:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bConnectedVertices","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"B-connection here is path-based, as B-Visit computes it: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" is B-connected to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":", or some hyperedge with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" among its targets is entered along a path"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" (it has a source, and all its sources are B-connected). So "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a hyperedge with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no sources never fires"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no path enters it, and B-Visit scans only the forward stars of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached vertices. The recursive reading (“every source is B-connected”) would fire it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vacuously from any start; Gallo et al.’s visit and halp do not."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Precondition","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a vertex."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"name":"Complexity","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(n + m + p): one counter per hyperedge and one queue; one hash."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/incidencelist\/bconnectedvertices(from:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/IncidenceList":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList","url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/incidencelist","kind":"symbol","title":"IncidenceList","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"IncidenceList","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A directed hypergraph stored as an incidence list: each hyperedge’s sources and targets, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each vertex’s out- and in-hyperedges (Gallo’s forward and backward stars), as two planes of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UndirectedIncidenceList"},{"type":"text","text":"’s storage. Unprefixed, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdjacencyList"},{"type":"text","text":" is the directed one of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pair. ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"},{"type":"text","text":" is the matrix form; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IncidenceMatrix"},{"type":"text","text":" is undirected, because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“oriented incidence matrix” is the established name.)"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"IncidenceList","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs":{"abstract":[],"title":"Hypergraphs","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs"},"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/IncidenceList/bConnectedVertices(from:)":{"title":"bConnectedVertices(from:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/bConnectedVertices(from:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every vertex B-connected to "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" included, in vertex-index order: Gallo et"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"al.‘s B-Visit (halp’s "},{"code":"b_visit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). A hyperedge fires once every one of its sources has been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached, and then reaches all its targets. On a directed graph read as a hypergraph this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reachability."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bConnectedVertices"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","te